# Accepted risks for Trivy (CI dependency + image scans). Every entry needs: WHY it is accepted,
# the evidence, and an expiry so it gets re-reviewed instead of ignored forever. Trivy stops
# honouring an entry after its exp: date, which turns CI red again on purpose.
# Reviewed 2026-10-01 — see log/M5-supply-chain.md (local audit notes).

# extract-zip 2.0.1 — symlink entries can write outside the target folder. No fixed release exists.
