# ip (via webtorrent 1.x -> bittorrent-tracker / ip-set) — isPublic() misclassifies some addresses.
# NOT REACHABLE: webtorrent only loads ip-set when a `blocklist` option is passed (GameTorrent never
# does), and bittorrent-tracker uses `ip` only in its tracker-SERVER code (lib/server/parse-udp.js);
# GameTorrent is purely a client. Proper fix = webtorrent 3.x (ESM-only major) — tracked in log/M5.
